{title: Ilaya Nila}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Balasubramaniam}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Ilaya [C] Nilaa Pozhigi [Dm] rathey,        Ithayam [C] Varai Nanaigi [Dm] rathey
[Dm] Ulaa Poagum Maegam Kanaa [C] Kaanumae.. [F],        Vizhaa [A#] Kaanumae Vaana [A] mae.. [Dm]
Varum Vaz [C] hiyil Panimazhai [Dm] yil,        [Dm] Paruva Nilaa Thinam Nanaiyum
Mugile [F] duthu Mugam Thuda [G] ithu,        Vidiyum [C] varai Nadai Pazhagum
Vanavee [Dm] thiyil Maega Oorvalam,        [Dm] Kaanum Pothilae Aaruthal Tharum
Paruva [C] magal Vizhiga [A#] lilae,        Kanavu [A] Varum.. [Dm]
[Dm] Ilaya [C] Nilaa Pozhigi [Dm] rathey,        Ithayam [C] Varai Nanaigi [Dm] rathey
[Dm] Ulaa Poagum Maegam Kanaa [C] Kaanumae.. [F],        Vizhaa [A#] Kaanumae Vaana [A] mae.. [Dm]
Mugilinan [C] gal Alaigira [Dm] they,        [Dm] Mugavarigal Tholainthanav
Mugavari [F] gal Thavariya [G] thaal,        Azhuthi [C] dum Athu Mazhaiy
Neelavaa [Dm] nilae Velli Odaigal,        [Dm] Orugindrathey Ènna Jaadaigal
Vinveli [C] yil Vithaithathu [A#] Yaar Navamani [A] gal
